cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "r2py_kernsmooth: a Python port of the R package KernSmooth"
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite all three of: the original R package
  KernSmooth; the r2py conversion-method paper; and this port at the version
  you ran. The numerical core of r2py_kernsmooth is KernSmooth's own Fortran
  code, retained unmodified. See the Citation section of the README for the
  full list.
type: software
