    title: "KernSmooth: Functions for Kernel Smoothing Supporting Wand & Jones (1995)"
    version: 2.23-26
    authors:
      - family-names: Wand
        given-names: Matt
    year: 2025
    url: "https://cran.r-project.org/package=KernSmooth"
    notes: >-
      Original R package; r2py_kernsmooth embeds its Fortran sources
      unmodified and translates its R layer to Python. R port and maintenance
      by Brian D. Ripley; LINPACK routines by Cleve Moler.
